OL,3,AWho is Norway's new King Haakon VIII?
OL,4,
OL,5,FKing Haakon VIII has inherited the
OL,6,FNorwegian throne after the death of his
OL,7,Ffather, Harald V. Many in Norway
OL,8,Fbelieve he has big shoes to fill.
OL,10,FKing Harald was immensely popular with
OL,11,Fordinary Norwegians, as shown by his
OL,12,Fconsistent high polling and the
OL,13,Foutpouring of emotion in the lead-up to
OL,14,Fhis death.
OL,16,FHaakon is the fourth king to head
OL,17,FNorway's modern monarchy, since it was
OL,18,Frestored in 1905 after the country
OL,19,Fgained independence from Sweden.
OL,23,APub: 28-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
