OL,3,AWho is Norway's new King Haakon VIII?
OL,4,
OL,5,FAmong his first duties as monarch, he
OL,6,Fled an extraordinary cabinet meeting
OL,7,Fwhere he announced his royal title and
OL,8,Fadopted his father's motto "Everything
OL,9,Ffor Norway".
